# Semgrep scan scope — mirror CodeQL's config (.github/codeql/codeql-config.yml).
#
# Scope SAST to SHIPPED product + ops code. Design prototypes, scratch dumps and
# regenerable build/coverage artifacts are NOT the product; scanning them only
# floods the code-scanning tab with noise (e.g. 197 unquoted-attribute-var and
# 9 wildcard-postMessage findings, all inside prototype/, drowned the signal).
#
# gitignore-style syntax. Semgrep already skips node_modules and .git by default.

# Design prototypes / mockups (Regla de Oro — Estructura: prototype/ is not product)
prototype/

# Transient scratch (gitignored working tree — never product)
_scratch/

# Regenerable build & coverage artifacts
coverage/
**/coverage/
**/lcov-report/
dist/
**/dist/
build/
**/build/
out/
**/out/
.expo/
**/.expo/
android/
ios/
